# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) boot 5: chain + all 24 optional dependencies, group A (SQ-CBO-10 to -17)
## SQ-CBO-10 | optional: 24 of 24, namespaces, potions registered
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 24 of 24
expect effects items by namespace: .*alexsmobs.*botania.*create_deep_dark.*dragonloot.*everythingcopper.*felsic_gear.*immersive_armors.*immersiveengineering.*supplementaries
> cbo potions
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
look record the potion ... registered lines (all true except quark:resilience and upgrade_aquatic:restfulness expected)
## SQ-CBO-11 | optional: counts above the chain
shell grep -h "\[CE potions\]\|\[food values\].*effect swaps\|\[alcohol\] food values\|tipped arrow tipping done\|potion bottling done\|jeed_providers.js:\|\[fluid_jei\]\|dragon-breath\|Lingerification" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | sed -E 's/^\[[^]]*\] \[[^]]*\]: //' | sort | uniq -c
kjsexpect potion bottling done \([1-9]
kjsexpect jeed_providers.js: [1-9][0-9]* effect provider recipes
bootexpect registered [1-9][0-9]* dragon-breath fluid-brewing recipes
bootexpect Lingerification: registered refinery list generator
shell grep -h "\[alcohol\] food values" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep "44 of 44"
shell ! grep -hE "better_beacons not present|\[CE potions\] mix skipped|effect .* not registered" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log
look mix and effect swap counts above SQ-CBO-02's; re-added [1-9]
## SQ-CBO-12 | optional: guarded brews
> zq potion creativecommon:long_reach minecraft:redstone
> zq potion minecraft:thick geode:wrappist_shard,geode:celestite_shard
> zq potion minecraft:awkward buzzier_bees:four_leaf_clover,buzzier_bees:silverfish_bottle
> zq potion minecraft:strong_swiftness alexsmobs:gazelle_horn
> zq potion alexsmobs:lava_vision minecraft:redstone
sleep 3
expect long_reach \+ minecraft:redstone -> .*long_long_reach
expect wrappist_shard -> .*long_reach
expect celestite_shard -> .*phantom_bane
expect four_leaf_clover -> .*luck
expect silverfish_bottle -> .*unluck
expect gazelle_horn -> .*speed_iii
expect lava_vision \+ minecraft:redstone -> .*long_lava_vision
## SQ-CBO-13 | optional: effect remaps and removals
> forceload add 0 0
sleep 1
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 0 -60 5 {Tags:["cbo"],NoAI:1b}
sleep 1
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] neapolitan:agility 60 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] fruitsdelight:chorus 60 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] quark:resilience 60 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] upgrade_aquatic:restfulness 60 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] upgrade_aquatic:insomnia 60 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] alexsmobs:power_down 60 0
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=cbo,limit=1] ActiveEffects
sleep 2
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
expect "forge:id": "vinery:climbing_effect"
expect "forge:id": "vinery:teleport"
expect "forge:id": "alexsmobs:knockback_resistance"
reject "forge:id": "neapolitan:agility"
reject "forge:id": "fruitsdelight:chorus"
reject "forge:id": "quark:resilience"
reject "forge:id": "upgrade_aquatic:restfulness"
reject "forge:id": "upgrade_aquatic:insomnia"
reject "forge:id": "alexsmobs:power_down"
## SQ-CBO-14 | optional: no CB server script skipped, winemaker, fermenting, effect providers
